Package: projr
Title: Facilitate Reproducible and Archived Projects
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Miguel", "Rodo", email = "miguel.rodo@uct.ac.za",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2036-4878")),
    person("Alexander", "Peslyak", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Bundled MD5 implementation")
    )
Maintainer: Miguel Rodo <miguel.rodo@uct.ac.za>
Description: Run R scripts and render 'Quarto', 'R Markdown' and 'bookdown'
    documents in a configured order. Record file hashes for each version of
    an analysis, archive its inputs and outputs locally or in 'GitHub'
    releases, and restore the inputs for a checked-out version.
